#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:3958
msgid ""
"Keep saved passwords and key passphrases in the settings folder, encrypted "
"with a master password, instead of this computer's keychain. Settings Sync "
"carries them, still encrypted. A forgotten master password cannot be "
"recovered: the saved passwords would have to be entered again."
msgstr "Gem gemte adgangskoder og nøgleadgangssætninger i indstillingsmappen, krypteret med en hovedadgangskode, i stedet for i denne computers nøglering. Synkronisering af indstillinger tager dem med, stadig krypteret. En glemt hovedadgangskode kan ikke gendannes: de gemte adgangskoder skal så indtastes igen."

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:3959
